To enable cloud-init on startup, put the following lines into
rc.local(8):

	/usr/local/lib/cloud-init/ds-identify

	cloud-init init --local

	cloud-init init

	cloud-init modules --mode config

	cloud-init modules --mode final

Note that ds-identify is optional.
On VM images, where the target cloud is known, a `ds-identify` run
can be replaced with a concrete `datasources_list` entry in
`/etc/cloud/cloud.cfg.d/`.
